silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_flat_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor_node2 silm:hasLongDescription "The 06_closureOperationNode is The operation or gate node for 06_closure. Closure: traverse all 4 active legs (evidence, storage, graph, trace). FedProfile(Mittens) reconstructed. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Operation or gate', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
